; Advanced records (--mode=objfpc, {$modeswitch advancedrecords}): the parse
; tree and checked tree of a record with visibility sections, a
; constructor, methods, a static class method, class operators and a
; property; operators and conversions are marked in the checked tree.
; RUN: %pcc --mode=objfpc --emit-parse-tree %S/Inputs/advrecords.pas -o %t.tree
; RUN: diff %S/Inputs/advrecords.tree %t.tree
; RUN: %pcc --mode=objfpc --emit-ast %S/Inputs/advrecords.pas -o %t.ast
; RUN: diff %S/Inputs/advrecords.ast %t.ast
